#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:42
msgid "``.png``"
msgstr "``.png``"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:35
msgid "``.pdf``"
msgstr "``.pdf``"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:37
msgid ""
"**assertions** — statements published as prose in the documentation, for the "
"freeports engine under ``docs/source/validation/assertions``: files of type"
msgstr ""
"**le asserzioni** — dichiarazioni pubblicate in prosa nella documentazione, per il "
"motore freeports sotto ``docs/source/validation/assertions``: file di tipo"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:40
msgid "``.rst``"
msgstr "``.rst``"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:41
